STIX Two fonts
==============

STIXTwoText-{Regular,Italic,Bold,BoldItalic}.otf and STIXTwoMath-Regular.otf
are the STIX Two fonts by The STIX Fonts Project Authors
(https://github.com/stipub/stixfonts), as distributed on CTAN (stix2-otf).

They are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (see OFL.txt in
this directory). The fonts are bundled unmodified inside the tekx binary; PDF
files produced by tekx embed subsets of them, which the OFL permits.
